{"title": "Throw Damage Immunity", "pageid": 40604, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Throw_Damage_Immunity", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Shield_Master_Shove.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Shield_Master_Shove.webp/300px-Shield_Master_Shove.webp, /w/images/2/28/Shield_Master_Shove.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Shield_Master_Shove.webp/300px-Shield_Master_Shove.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Shield_Master_Shove.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Throw Damage Immunity</b> is a passive feature exclusive to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boo\" title=\"Boo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Portrait_Boo.png/25px-Portrait_Boo.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Portrait_Boo.png/38px-Portrait_Boo.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Portrait_Boo.png/50px-Portrait_Boo.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Boo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Portrait_Boo.png/25px-Portrait_Boo.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Portrait_Boo.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Boo\" title=\"Boo\">Boo</a> which prevents him from receiving any damage when thrown.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Creature is immune to being damaged by being thrown. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Boo\" title=\"Boo\">Boo</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>When thrown, characters receive one turn of a hidden technical condition <code>PRONE_AFTER_THROW</code> that is removed on taking damage, and when removed applies <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a> to the character. Normally, the damage taken from being thrown would trigger the removal of this technical condition and apply Prone, but this passive prevents that damage. Instead, the technical condition remains and ticks down at the start of the thrown character's turn, causing a delayed application of Prone.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203225\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPrepro